            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Alabama, the Court held that Alabama\u2019s 2021 congressional redistricting plan violates \u00a7\u202f2 of the Voting Rights Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Alabama",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6840b046da54008719ca4ba28f7caf8a99804ba229412b0f4a3d66a92497c0a0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6840b046da54-0004-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Alabama, the Court rejected Alabama\u2019s argument that \u00a7\u202f2, as applied to redistricting, is unconstitutional under the Fifteenth Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6840b046da54008719ca4ba28f7caf8a99804ba229412b0f4a3d66a92497c0a0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6840b046da54-0004-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 43,
              "start": 43
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh, joined by Justice Gorsuch, concurred that Alabama\u2019s redistricting plan violates \u00a7\u202f2 of the Voting Rights Act as interpreted in Thornburg v. Gingles."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6840b046da54008719ca4ba28f7caf8a99804ba229412b0f4a3d66a92497c0a0",
            "evidence_ids": [
